This live image was built with linux-gaming-lab, an experimental,
unofficial customization layer on top of CachyOS-Live-ISO.

It is not an official CachyOS image and is not supported by the CachyOS team.

  Project:  https://github.com/ralleur/linux-gaming-lab
  Upstream: https://github.com/CachyOS/CachyOS-Live-ISO

The file build-info next to this README records the exact project revision,
upstream commit, profile, overlays and patches used for this image.
